<title>NETHERLANDS: NORIT ACQUIRES 49 PCT MEXICAN CARBON FIRM.</title>
<headline>NORIT ACQUIRES 49 PCT MEXICAN CARBON FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch carbon maker Norit said on Friday that it's American unit Norit Americas Inc had acquired a 49 percent stake in Mexican carbon maker NAI.</p>
<p>NAI has an annual turnover of about 20 million guilders.</p>
<p>The deal will have a slightly positive effect on 1997 results, Norit said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
